```

3. Controlling the camera's movement using helper methods:

```typescript
// Move forward by a given distance
camera.moveForward(distance);

// Move left or right by a given distance
camera.moveSideways(distance);

// Move up or down by a given distance
camera.moveVertical(distance);

// Look at the target position
camera.lookAt(targetPosition);
```

4. Animating the camera with smooth transitions:

```typescript
// Move the camera to a new position over a given time frame
camera.animateTo({ position: new Vector3(newX, newY, newZ) }, duration, easingFunction);

// Animate the camera's rotation around its target
camera.animateRotationAroundTarget({ degrees: newAngle }, duration, easingFunction);
```

