```
Replace `<url-pattern-of-the-webpage>` with the URL pattern or patterns of the webpages where you want to inject the script.

3. In the `background.js` file, listen for a message from the content script and send a message back to it to execute the injection:

```javascript
chrome.runtime.onMessage.addListener(function(request, sender, sendResponse) {
